    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your dungeon against an onslaught of heroes in this physics-enabled tower defense. Build your dungeon tile by tile, placing deadly traps to protect your loot. Upgrade your defenses and powers as you amass wealth and unleash havoc on these cheese wheel-stealing 'heroes'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/29af810e023e9816da6e0890995cad4f.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build your dungeon</strong>, your way. Place tile by tile, and fill your dungeon with deadly traps to keep the pesky heroes away from your loot. As you level up, you gain the ability to place more and more tiles to further grow your dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/017d94734acfb6a4f704c08ee6ce8ca9.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/2ddc25f72d68256262352255e425e822.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/2ddc25f72d68256262352255e425e822.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/2ddc25f72d68256262352255e425e822.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unleash havoc</strong> with your traps. With physics enabled, send heroes flying around - or even play bowling with their bodies! You can even light them on fire or electrocute them. What fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/a873b69b22b03361332e1b469b7da8ff.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/a873b69b22b03361332e1b469b7da8ff.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/a873b69b22b03361332e1b469b7da8ff.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong> of the stolen cheese wheels in a plot against the town by a secretive guild of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/fef6e57ff750feba51d1d8de26220a42.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/fef6e57ff750feba51d1d8de26220a42.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/fef6e57ff750feba51d1d8de26220a42.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Defeat powerful foes</strong> that cast an array of magical powers. It's oh so worth it to fell these baddies, because they drop some seriously good loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/70bade8cb8c73ea5f85d319295629b78.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/4158fac1c5cc3de6b927e347a3a42d7c.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/4158fac1c5cc3de6b927e347a3a42d7c.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/4158fac1c5cc3de6b927e347a3a42d7c.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Expand your town</strong> to increase your potential. Unlock and upgrade buildings like the forge, scriptorium, town hall, and more. The villagers are happy to help you in any way they can to get their precious cheese wheels back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/8b3b14456b0b72c25e783d3a8ab6cebc.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/8b3b14456b0b72c25e783d3a8ab6cebc.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/8b3b14456b0b72c25e783d3a8ab6cebc.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Learn new powers</strong> and barrage your foes with them. With only 4 slots available, you must be strategic with your selection. It's extra satisfying to blast the heroes around - especially into each other. Collateral damage is totally a thing here! Use your abilities wisely and you can cause some serious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Grow your power</strong>. As you're beating up heroes, they'll drop their loot for you (how generous). Take your well-earned loot and use it to further power up your dungeon! With an array of masteries that improve the damage of your traps, allow you to build more tiles, improve your gold and item find, and many more - you can be sure there's plenty of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/9cd48a9b1704fd1b96e2d9a9b721afe6.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting this indie dev with a <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> - it means the world to me as I strive to create fun and engaging games for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* No heroes were harmed in the making of this game.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your dungeon against an onslaught of heroes in this physics-enabled tower defense. Build your dungeon tile by tile, placing deadly traps to protect your loot. Upgrade your defenses and powers as you amass wealth and unleash havoc on these cheese wheel-stealing 'heroes'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/29af810e023e9816da6e0890995cad4f.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/0310b0f0069b8fe2f662e4b64cec2db0.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build your dungeon</strong>, your way. Place tile by tile, and fill your dungeon with deadly traps to keep the pesky heroes away from your loot. As you level up, you gain the ability to place more and more tiles to further grow your dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/017d94734acfb6a4f704c08ee6ce8ca9.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/2ddc25f72d68256262352255e425e822.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source