foes with them. With only 4 slots available, you must be strategic with your selection. It's extra satisfying to blast the heroes around - especially into each other. Collateral damage is totally a thing here! Use your abilities wisely and you can cause some serious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.poster.avif?t=1753930427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.webm?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/e16166754cbf835a27166d96418de314.mp4?t=1753930427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Grow your power</strong>. As you're beating up heroes, they'll drop their loot for you (how generous). Take your well-earned loot and use it to further power up your dungeon! With an array of masteries that improve the damage of your traps, allow you to build more tiles, improve your gold and item find, and many more - you can be sure there's plenty of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497980/extras/9cd48a9b1704fd1b96e2d9a9b721afe6.avif?t=1753930427\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting this indie dev with a <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> - it means the world to me as I strive to create fun and engaging games for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* No heroes were harmed in the making of this game.</i></p>",
